WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Standing heavy kick launches Ryu on Punish Counter.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.000
Ken uses raw Drive Rush to reach the airborne Ryu.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.050
Standing heavy punch connects after the Rush.

4
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.500
The delayed running Tatsumaki moves both characters across the stage.

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.800
Ryu lands after the traveling Tatsumaki finish.
